WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.536
-Dude Perfect! Hey, guys.
-How's it going?

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:04.837
-Oh, Jimmy!

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.206
-Dude, I'm big fans of you guys.
You guys are amazing.

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:10.576
I want to hear about this
documentary thing.

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:13.980
When is that coming out?
-It's coming out on May 11th.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.981
We're super-excited about it.

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:16.449
It tells our whole
10-year story.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.351
We are super, super pumped.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.353
-I mean, I can't wait to see it,

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.789
'cause what you guys have done
is just -- It's amazing.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:23.923
It's impossible.

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:26.459
How are you guys dealing
with the quarantine?

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.060
Everyone -- You guys
hanging in there?

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.129
-Yeah, we're doing good.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:31.731
I think there's been
a massive spike

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:35.769
in at-home trick shots for sure,
so just trying to do that.

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:40.139
You know, I'm not a huge reader,
but just trying to read books.

00:00:40.139 --> 00:00:44.110
-No spoiling.
-But, yeah, we're doing good.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.145
We've done some trick shots
with the kids at home,

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.781
so we're doing okay.

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:48.848
-What's the trust-shot thing

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:49.983
that you guys were
talking about?

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.350
I heard you have a video for me?

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:52.752
-Yeah, we got a video
to show you.

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:55.421
We decided to get our kids
involved, do some trust shots,

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:57.456
kind of a staple from
the trick-shot video.

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.325
So we can take a look
at that if you want to.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.459
-Let's take a look.

00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:02.795
Here's some trust shots --
Dude Perfect.

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:04.397
-How we feeling, Buster?
-Good.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.432
-Are we ready to do a
trust shot?

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.866
-Yeah.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.068
-The first-ever father/son trust
shot in Dude Perfect history?

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:10.102
-Yeah.

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.704
-We always do
safety first, right?

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.607
-Okay.
-Okay. Okay.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.275
Can you say,
"This is the trust shot"?

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:18.845
-The trust shot.
-We'll subtitle it.

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.714
Here we go.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:24.083
-Hey! We did it!

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:26.118
-Great job. High five?

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:28.621
Thumbs up?
-Love you, daddy.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:34.193
-I love you too, buddy.
High five. Good job.

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:38.364
-Whoo!
-Let's go!

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.732
-Hey, Jimmy.
Hope you're doing great.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.201
For my trust shot, I've decided
to take party hats --

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:43.669
who needs those
during quarantine? --

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:45.938
and, instead,
make red Solo-cup hats.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.272
Not a sponsor.

00:01:47.272 --> 00:01:49.108
I've got twins, so we're going
to see how this goes.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.777
Do not worry about
the giraffe on the ground.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:53.846
He's fine.
Can you wave to Jimmy?

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:56.649
-Hi, Crew!
-Can you wave to Mr. Fallon?

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:59.152
Yeah.
I got my little buddy, Crew.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.254
I'm gonna throw a ball into
the cup on his head.

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:05.591
Hey, Crew, smile for Jimmy.

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:12.132
I'm going to throw a ball and
knock it off his head.

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:16.469
-You want to listen to
"Baby Shark"?

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:20.106
-Got it! Thanks, Jimmy.

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:21.541
-Hey, Jimmy.
What's going on, man?

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:24.244
Babe, you have nothing
to worry about.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:27.313
Time for a husband-wife
trust shot.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:30.282
Here we go, babe.

00:02:30.282 --> 00:02:33.653
Oh-ho! Hey-yo!

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.121
Thanks, Jimmy!

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:37.657
-This is hard.
-No, you're doing great.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:43.329
-Alright, say "Hi, Jimmy."
-Hi, Jimmy!

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:47.934
-Whoo! We made it!
Clap.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:51.170
Say "yay!"
-Yay!

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:54.407
-Whoo-hoo!
-Can I watch TV now?

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:57.076
-Yes, you can watch TV now.
High five.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:58.144
You get to go watch TV.

00:02:58.144 --> 00:02:59.812
We're going to
watch "The Tonight Show."

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:02.649
Yippee!
Pound it! Noggin! See ya!

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:05.184
-Nice!

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:08.688
Wow. You got some
really trustworthy kids there.

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:11.357
-Yes.

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:15.394
-Would you ever let your kid
try to shoot one off you?

00:03:15.394 --> 00:03:18.164
-There's a reason that we
typically do it the other way,

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:21.634
but I'm down for trying one
the other direction.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:25.371
We could try that out.
Want to see another round?

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:27.306
Barry, you want to do
a trick shot?

00:03:27.306 --> 00:03:28.774
You want to do
a trick shot for Jimmy?

00:03:28.774 --> 00:03:30.343
-Yeah.
-Can you say, "Hey, Mr. Jimmy"?

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:31.443
-Hey, Jimmy!

00:03:31.443 --> 00:03:33.646
-Hi, buddy!
Nice to see you, man.

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:36.715
-This is Barrett.
-Hi, Barrett.

00:03:36.715 --> 00:03:38.685
-Yeah? Okay,
you got to get set up,

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:42.421
and we got to tell Mr. Jimmy
what the trick shot is, okay?

00:03:42.421 --> 00:03:43.823
-Okay.
-Alright.

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.958
Here, you get -- I got some
balls for you right there.

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:50.029
-Don't hold your breath
on this one, Jimmy.

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:54.567
-Trick shot!
-It's a trust shot.

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:57.136
-It's live.

00:03:57.136 --> 00:04:01.741
-Oh!
-Why?

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.309
-He's a natural.

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:06.079
-We got a Clayton Kershaw
on our hands.

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.413
-That's amazing.
-He's a natural. He's an ace.

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:09.782
-Wow!

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:12.552
-Hey, the future generation
is secure.

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:16.555
-Guys, I got to tell you, I have
like 30 balls in that basket,

00:04:16.555 --> 00:04:18.624
'cause I did not see it
going that way.

00:04:18.624 --> 00:04:21.493
-Oh, my gosh.
You were awesome, buddy.

00:04:21.493 --> 00:04:22.961
That was fantastic.

00:04:22.961 --> 00:04:25.698
-I want to see you challenge
a kid or have a --

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:28.434
You get involved in
a trust shot.

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:31.537
-Oh, I -- Oh, no. Uh-oh.
What are you guys doing here?

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:34.573
Oh. You guys?
-Yeah, I like the --

00:04:34.573 --> 00:04:37.076
-Would you guys like to do
a trust shot?

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:39.545
Alright, Winnie, Franny,
you go over here.

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:45.251
Alright. Oops.
-Sorry.

00:04:45.251 --> 00:04:50.122
-You wanted one, you got one.
Wait. Sorry. We're back.

00:04:50.122 --> 00:04:52.558
You think that was funny?
-Yeah.

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:55.328
-Yeah.
-That was not funny.

00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:56.663
It was not.

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:58.598
-Alright.

00:04:58.598 --> 00:05:00.532
Alright, guys, say hi to --
Hold on.

00:05:00.532 --> 00:05:02.334
Say hi to everybody.
-Hi.

00:05:02.334 --> 00:05:04.704
-Hey, girls.
-Hey!

00:05:04.704 --> 00:05:06.772
-Alright.
-Hi!

00:05:06.772 --> 00:05:09.975
-So, we don't have any --
-Hi!

00:05:09.975 --> 00:05:12.111
-A merry-go-round.
-Alright, alright, alright.

00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:13.612
Alright, very good, guys.
Hey, look.

00:05:13.612 --> 00:05:16.148
-Hi!
-Hi!

00:05:16.148 --> 00:05:18.550
-All right, alright. Ready?
Hit the cup.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:22.288
-You got to throw it real high.
-Ooh, you're close.

00:05:22.288 --> 00:05:25.758
-Hey! All right!

00:05:25.758 --> 00:05:28.461
-Good job.
-I did it!

00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:30.362
-Good job. Oh, my gosh.

00:05:30.362 --> 00:05:35.368
Thank you, guys, for teaching my
kids really cool games.

00:05:35.368 --> 00:05:37.703
Congrats on everything, guys.
Congrats on the documentary.

00:05:37.703 --> 00:05:39.605
And I can't wait to see
you guys in person.

00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:41.640
Keep up the great work.
-Appreciate it.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:42.742
-Appreciate it, Jimmy.
-Thanks for having us on.

